"entity": {
"name": "Brightstar Lottery PLC",
"description": "Brightstar Lottery PLC engages in the designing, manufacturing, and marketing of electronic gaming equipment, software, and network systems. It operates through the Global Lottery, Global Gaming, and PlayDigital segments. The Global Lottery segment has responsibility for the worldwide traditional lottery and iLottery business, including sales, operations, product development, technology, and support. The Global Gaming segment includes iGaming, sports betting, sales, product management, studios, global manufacturing, operations, and technology. The PlayDigital segment has full responsibility for the worldwide iGaming and sports betting activities. The company was founded in 1990 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.",
